# Environment "karateclub": Graph2Vec and FGSD (unsupervised whole-graph embeddings).
# Python 3.10.
#
# KarateClub 1.3.3 (22 Oct 2022) is the last release. It needs numpy<1.23, networkx<2.7
# and pandas<=1.3.5, and networkx 2.6 calls scipy.errstate, which SciPy 1.12 removed.
# The lock is therefore resolved as of 1 Nov 2022 (uv --exclude-newer), which gives the
# package versions the library was released against.
#
# psutil is ours, not KarateClub's: it measures memory. It is exempt from the date limit
# (--exclude-newer-package) and pinned to the version the main environment uses, so both
# environments measure with the same tool. Old psutil also has no Linux ARM wheels.
karateclub==1.3.3
pyyaml
psutil==7.2.2
